## Design Explanation
### Why did you choose this class?
--I am interested in video games. Out of every topic I thought to pick, it stood out to me as I like talking about it. Things discussing video games are very broad and vast, so making a class for even a singular aspect of it could have a hundred different methods and properties. Because of this, it was easy to answer.
### Which property is the most important? Why?
--It is the 'Genre' from the available properties. It defines what makes the video game special to an audience's interests. Because of this interest, people can select what kind of games they wish to play.
### Which method is the most useful? Why?
--Out of the methods, the 'Load' method is the most useful. A user doesn't continuously delete, update, or uninstall a game. The load method will be used every time the game is in need of use.